3MF thumbnails (ORDER 17): a plugin of its own, threemfthumbnail, takes model/3mf from opendocumentthumbnail. It shows the picture the slicer embedded in the file (Metadata/thumbnail.png) and, when the file has none, the model drawn as a stereo pair by f3d-thumbnail-pair (F3D of the edition), so a 3MF always has a picture. The person's option: ThreeMFPreferRender=true in the PreviewSettings group of kdeglobals draws the model first. Without F3D installed the embedded picture is the only one.
